        "description": "Seconds from the template start when each element appears, in order: heading, card 1, card 2, card 3, card 4, card 5, card 6, string 1, string 2, string 3, string 4, string 5, string 6. Fixed slots: heading → card 1…6 → string 1…6. Send null for slots you do not use. Compute as (spoken word time − beat start time) from WhisperX."
